sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set dispatch.batch 1
send p1 alice rx low one
send p2 alice rx prio=low low two
send p3 alice ny prio=high high three
send p4 alice tokyo prio=urgent urgent four
send p5 alice rx prio=urgent urgent five
send p6 alice ny prio=normal normal six
queue
advance 10s
